        {
          "block_label": "display_formula",
          "block_content": " $$ \\begin{aligned}F(x)&=\\max\\{-3x-3,0\\}-\\max\\{5x,0\\}+3x+2\\\\&=(-3x-3+|3x+3|)/2\\\\&\\quad-(5x+|5x|)/2+3x+2\\\\&=|(3x+3)/2|-|5x/2|-x+\\frac{1}{2},\\end{aligned} $$ ",
          "block_bbox": [
            321,
