          ]
        },
        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "and similarly  $ 2b_{2n} + b_{2n-1} = b_{2n+1} $, so that  $ \\{b_n\\} $ satisfies the same recurrence as  $ \\{a_n\\} $. Since further  $ b_0 = 1 $,  $ b_1 = 2 $ (where we use the recurrence for  $ \\{a_n\\} $ to calculate  $ a_{-1} = 0 $), we deduce that  $ b_n = a_n $ for all n. In particular,  $ a_n^2 + a_{n+1}^2 = b_{2n+2} = a_{2n+2} $.",
          "block_bbox": [
