          "block_content": " $$ \\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{1-2x-x^{2}}\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{2}}\\left(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}+1}{1-(1+\\sqrt{2})x}+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}-1}{1-(1-\\sqrt{2})x}\\right)\\end{aligned} $$ ",
